       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
      *****************************************************************
      * CABING03 - DUPLICATE / OUT-OF-SEQUENCE NUMBER DETECTION       *
      * APPLICATION : CABS                                            *
      * INPUTS      : VLDIN   TELCABS.CABS.USAGE.VALID(0)   CABSCDR   *
      * OUTPUTS     : DUPOUT  TELCABS.CABS.USAGE.DEDUP(+1)  CABSCDR   *
      *               SUSOUT  TELCABS.CABS.USAGE.SUSPENSE(+1) CABSERR *
      * CONTROL     : CTLOUT                               CABSCTL    *
      * BALANCE     : CT-READ = CT-WRITTEN + CT-REJECTED +            *
      *               CT-SUMMARISED + CT-CARRIED-FWD                  *
      * RESTART     : FULL RERUN - VLDIN MUST BE PRESORTED BY         *
      *               CD-OCN, CD-BAN, CD-SEQ-NBR ON EVERY RERUN       *
      * REVISION HISTORY                                              *
      *   V1.00  1989-05-09  R.T.WHEELER  INITIAL - DUP CHECK ONLY    *
      *   V1.10  1992-02-27  D.OKONKWO    ADDED GAP REPORTING COUNT   *
      *   V1.20  1996-10-11  J.M.CASTILLO WINDOW WIDENED 25 TO 50     *
      *   V1.30  2001-07-03  P.NAIR       GAP RECORDS ROUTE TO        *
      *                                   SUSOUT WITH EC-DUP-SEQ      *
      *   V1.40  2007-03-19  A.BUKOWSKI   OCN/BAN GROUP BREAK RESET   *
      *                                   OF THE WINDOW ADDED         *
      *   V1.41  2011-08-24  S.MARCHETTI  RECOMPILE - NO LOGIC CHANGE *
      *   V1.50  2015-01-30  K.ADEYEMI    PERFORMANCE - WINDOW SEARCH *
      *                                   SHORT-CIRCUITS ON FIRST HIT *
      *   V1.51  2019-06-12  T.VANCE      RECOMPILE ONLY - LE V7 MIGR *
      *****************************************************************
       PROGRAM-ID.    CABING03.
       AUTHOR.        RADIANT-DIGITAL-CABS-TEAM.
       DATE-WRITTEN.  1989-05-09.
       DATE-COMPILED.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.   IBM-370.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.   IBM-370.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT VLDIN   ASSIGN TO VLDIN
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS  IS WS-FS-INPUT.
           SELECT DUPOUT  ASSIGN TO DUPOUT
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS  IS WS-FS-OUTPUT.
           SELECT SUSOUT  ASSIGN TO SUSOUT
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS  IS WS-FS-SUSPENSE.
           SELECT CTLOUT  ASSIGN TO CTLOUT
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS  IS WS-FS-CONTROL.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  VLDIN
           RECORDING MODE IS F
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           BLOCK CONTAINS 0 RECORDS
           RECORD CONTAINS 200 CHARACTERS.
           COPY CABSCDR.

       FD  DUPOUT
           RECORDING MODE IS F
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           BLOCK CONTAINS 0 RECORDS
           RECORD CONTAINS 200 CHARACTERS.
       01  DUP-OUT-RECORD               PIC X(200).

       FD  SUSOUT
           RECORDING MODE IS F
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           BLOCK CONTAINS 0 RECORDS
           RECORD CONTAINS 300 CHARACTERS.
       01  SUS-OUT-RECORD                PIC X(300).

       FD  CTLOUT
           RECORDING MODE IS F
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           BLOCK CONTAINS 0 RECORDS
           RECORD CONTAINS 180 CHARACTERS.
       01  CTL-OUT-RECORD                PIC X(180).

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY CABSWRK.

      * OWN WORKING STORAGE - CABSWRK SUPPLIES THE STANDARD SWITCHES,
      * COUNTERS, ACCUMULATORS, FILE STATUS, ERROR CODES, SUSPENSE
      * LAYOUT, DATE WORK AREA AND CONTROL RECORD.
       01  WS-PGM-CONSTANTS.
           05  WS-PGM-NAME              PIC X(08) VALUE 'CABING03'.

       01  WS-PARM-CARD-AREA.
           05  WS-PARM-RUN-ID           PIC X(12).
           05  WS-PARM-CYCLE-YYDDD      PIC 9(05).
           05  WS-PARM-RERUN-NBR        PIC 9(02).
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(61).

      * PRIOR-RECORD KEY, KEPT AS A COMBINED FIELD SO A GROUP BREAK
      * CAN BE TESTED WITH A SINGLE COMPARE INSTEAD OF TWO.
       01  WS-LAST-KEY-AREA.
           05  WS-LAST-OCN              PIC X(04).
           05  WS-LAST-BAN              PIC X(13).
       01  WS-LAST-KEY-ALPHA REDEFINES WS-LAST-KEY-AREA.
           05  WS-LAST-OCNBAN           PIC X(17).
       01  WS-LAST-SEQ                  PIC 9(09).

       01  WS-CURR-KEY-AREA.
           05  WS-CURR-OCN              PIC X(04).
           05  WS-CURR-BAN               PIC X(13).
       01  WS-CURR-KEY-ALPHA REDEFINES WS-CURR-KEY-AREA.
           05  WS-CURR-OCNBAN           PIC X(17).

       01  WS-FIRST-OF-GROUP-SW         PIC X(01).
           88  WS-FIRST-OF-GROUP        VALUE 'Y'.

       01  WS-SEQ-DELTA                 PIC S9(09) COMP-3.
       01  WS-GAP-CNT                   PIC S9(09) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
       01  WS-GAP-FOUND-SW              PIC X(01).
           88  WS-GAP-FOUND             VALUE 'Y'.
       01  WS-DUP-FOUND-SW              PIC X(01).
           88  WS-DUP-FOUND             VALUE 'Y'.

      * MANAGEMENT-REPORTING COUNTERS - THESE ARE SEPARATE FROM
      * WS-REJECT-CNT (WHICH FEEDS CT-REJECTED) SO OPERATIONS CAN
      * TELL DUPLICATES, GAPS AND WINDOW WRAPS APART ON THE RUN
      * LOG WITHOUT HAVING TO RECONCILE THE CONTROL RECORD.
       01  WS-RUN-STATISTICS.
           05  WS-DUP-CNT               PIC S9(09) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
           05  WS-GROUP-CNT             PIC S9(07) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
           05  WS-WINDOW-WRAP-CNT       PIC S9(07) COMP-3 VALUE 0.

      * HIGHEST SEQUENCE NUMBER SEEN SO FAR IN THE CURRENT GROUP -
      * INFORMATIONAL ONLY, NOT USED IN ANY EDIT DECISION.
       01  WS-MAX-SEQ-SEEN              PIC 9(09) VALUE 0.
       01  WS-MAX-SEQ-ALPHA REDEFINES WS-MAX-SEQ-SEEN
                                        PIC X(09).

      * ROLLING WINDOW - LAST 50 SEQUENCE NUMBERS SEEN IN THE
      * CURRENT OCN/BAN GROUP.  ROUND-ROBIN REFILL, SUBSCRIPTED
      * LINEAR SEARCH - NO SEARCH VERB, NO REFERENCE MODIFICATION.
       01  WS-WINDOW-CONTROL.
           05  WS-WINDOW-COUNT          PIC S9(04) COMP.
           05  WS-WINDOW-PTR            PIC S9(04) COMP.
           05  WS-WIN-SUB               PIC S9(04) COMP.

       01  WS-SEQ-WINDOW-TABLE.
           05  WS-SEQ-WINDOW OCCURS 50 TIMES
                                        PIC 9(09).

       01  WS-DUP-SEQ-DISPLAY           PIC 9(09).
       01  WS-DUP-SEQ-ALPHA REDEFINES WS-DUP-SEQ-DISPLAY
                                        PIC X(09).

       01  WS-CALL-PARM-AREA.
           05  WS-HASH-SEQ-IN           PIC S9(09) COMP-3.
           05  WS-HASH-OCN-IN           PIC X(04).

       01  WS-ABEND-CD                  PIC X(04).
       01  WS-ABEND-RSN                 PIC X(40).
       01  WS-DETECT-PARA-LIT           PIC X(30).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       S000-MAINLINE SECTION.
       P0000-MAINLINE.
           PERFORM P1000-INIT THRU P1000-EXIT.
           PERFORM P2000-PROCESS THRU P2000-EXIT
               UNTIL WS-EOF.
           PERFORM P8000-CONTROL THRU P8000-EXIT.
           PERFORM P9000-TERM THRU P9000-EXIT.
           STOP RUN.

       S100-INIT SECTION.
       P1000-INIT.
           PERFORM P1100-OPEN-FILES THRU P1100-EXIT.
           PERFORM P1200-READ-PARM-CARD THRU P1200-EXIT.
           PERFORM P1300-INIT-WORK THRU P1300-EXIT.
           PERFORM P2100-READ-VLDIN THRU P2100-EXIT.
       P1000-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       P1100-OPEN-FILES.
           OPEN INPUT  VLDIN.
           OPEN OUTPUT DUPOUT.
           OPEN OUTPUT SUSOUT.
           OPEN OUTPUT CTLOUT.
           IF WS-FS-INPUT NOT = '00'
               MOVE 'I001' TO WS-ABEND-CD
               MOVE 'CABING03 - VLDIN OPEN FAILED' TO WS-ABEND-RSN
               CALL 'CABABEND' USING WS-ABEND-CD WS-ABEND-RSN.
       P1100-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       P1200-READ-PARM-CARD.
           CALL 'CABPARMR' USING WS-PARM-CARD-AREA.
           MOVE WS-PARM-RUN-ID          TO CT-RUN-ID.
           MOVE WS-PGM-NAME             TO CT-PROCESS-ID.
           MOVE WS-PARM-CYCLE-YYDDD     TO CT-CYCLE-YYDDD.
           MOVE WS-PARM-RERUN-NBR       TO CT-RERUN-NBR.
           MOVE 2                       TO CT-STEP-SEQ.
       P1200-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      * FIRST-OF-GROUP STARTS TRUE SO THE VERY FIRST RECORD READ
      * NEVER TRIGGERS A FALSE GAP AGAINST AN EMPTY LAST-KEY.
       P1300-INIT-WORK.
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-LAST-OCNBAN.
           MOVE ZERO   TO WS-LAST-SEQ.
           MOVE ZERO   TO WS-WINDOW-COUNT.
           MOVE ZERO   TO WS-WINDOW-PTR.
           MOVE 'Y'    TO WS-FIRST-OF-GROUP-SW.
       P1300-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       S200-PROCESS SECTION.
       P2000-PROCESS.
           MOVE CD-OCN TO WS-CURR-OCN.
           MOVE CD-BAN TO WS-CURR-BAN.
           PERFORM P3100-CHECK-GROUP-BREAK THRU P3100-EXIT.
           PERFORM P3200-CHECK-SEQ-GAP THRU P3300-EXIT.
           IF WS-DUP-FOUND
               PERFORM P3600-BUILD-DUP-SUSPENSE THRU P3600-EXIT
           ELSE
               PERFORM P3700-WRITE-DUP-OUT THRU P3700-EXIT.
           PERFORM P3400-UPDATE-WINDOW THRU P3400-EXIT.
           PERFORM P3500-SAVE-LAST-KEY THRU P3500-EXIT.
           PERFORM P2100-READ-VLDIN THRU P2100-EXIT.
       P2000-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       P2100-READ-VLDIN.
           READ VLDIN
               AT END
                   MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF-SW
               NOT AT END
                   ADD 1 TO WS-READ-CNT.
       P2100-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       S300-SEQCHECK SECTION.
      * OCN/BAN CHANGED FROM THE PRIOR RECORD - START A NEW GROUP
      * AND CLEAR THE ROLLING WINDOW SO A DIFFERENT ACCOUNT NEVER
      * MATCHES AGAINST A STALE SEQUENCE NUMBER.
       P3100-CHECK-GROUP-BREAK.
           IF WS-FIRST-TIME
               MOVE 'Y' TO WS-FIRST-OF-GROUP-SW
               MOVE 'N' TO WS-FIRST-TIME-SW
           ELSE
               IF WS-CURR-OCNBAN NOT = WS-LAST-OCNBAN
                   MOVE 'Y' TO WS-FIRST-OF-GROUP-SW
                   MOVE ZERO TO WS-WINDOW-COUNT
                   MOVE ZERO TO WS-WINDOW-PTR
               ELSE
                   MOVE 'N' TO WS-FIRST-OF-GROUP-SW.
           IF WS-FIRST-OF-GROUP
               PERFORM P3150-TRACK-GROUP-STATS THRU P3150-EXIT.
       P3100-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      * ONE ENTRY PER OCN/BAN GROUP FOR THE RUN LOG.  THE MAXIMUM
      * SEQUENCE FIELD RESETS AT EVERY GROUP BREAK - IT IS NEVER
      * COMPARED ACROSS GROUPS, ONLY CARRIED FOR THE CURRENT ONE.
       P3150-TRACK-GROUP-STATS.
           ADD 1 TO WS-GROUP-CNT.
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-MAX-SEQ-SEEN.
       P3150-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      * GAP CHECK - A FORWARD JUMP OF MORE THAN ONE IN CD-SEQ-NBR
      * WITHIN THE SAME GROUP IS REPORTED AND COUNTS AS A REJECT
      * FOR CONTROL PURPOSES SINCE THE MISSING RECORDS NEED
      * RESEARCH BEFORE THE GROUP CAN BE CONSIDERED COMPLETE.
       P3200-CHECK-SEQ-GAP.
           MOVE 'N' TO WS-GAP-FOUND-SW.
           IF NOT WS-FIRST-OF-GROUP
               COMPUTE WS-SEQ-DELTA = CD-SEQ-NBR - WS-LAST-SEQ
               IF WS-SEQ-DELTA > 1
                   ADD 1 TO WS-GAP-CNT
                   ADD 1 TO WS-REJECT-CNT
                   MOVE 'Y' TO WS-GAP-FOUND-SW.

       P3300-CHECK-SEQ-DUP.
           MOVE 'N' TO WS-DUP-FOUND-SW.
           PERFORM P3310-SEARCH-WINDOW THRU P3310-EXIT
               VARYING WS-WIN-SUB FROM 1 BY 1
               UNTIL WS-WIN-SUB > WS-WINDOW-COUNT
               OR WS-DUP-FOUND.
           IF WS-DUP-FOUND
               ADD 1 TO WS-REJECT-CNT
               ADD 1 TO WS-DUP-CNT.
       P3300-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       P3310-SEARCH-WINDOW.
           IF WS-SEQ-WINDOW (WS-WIN-SUB) = CD-SEQ-NBR
               MOVE 'Y' TO WS-DUP-FOUND-SW.
       P3310-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      * ROUND-ROBIN INSERT OF THE CURRENT SEQUENCE NUMBER, EVEN
      * WHEN IT WAS FLAGGED AS A DUPLICATE - THE WINDOW TRACKS
      * WHAT WAS SEEN, NOT WHAT WAS ACCEPTED.
       P3400-UPDATE-WINDOW.
           ADD 1 TO WS-WINDOW-PTR.
           IF WS-WINDOW-PTR > 50
               MOVE 1 TO WS-WINDOW-PTR
               PERFORM P3450-COUNT-WRAP THRU P3450-EXIT.
           IF WS-WINDOW-COUNT < 50
               ADD 1 TO WS-WINDOW-COUNT.
           MOVE CD-SEQ-NBR TO WS-SEQ-WINDOW (WS-WINDOW-PTR).
       P3400-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      * WINDOW-WRAP COUNT IS PURELY INFORMATIONAL - IT TELLS
      * OPERATIONS HOW OFTEN A SINGLE BAN EXCEEDED 50 CDRS IN ONE
      * BILLING CYCLE, WHICH HISTORICALLY FLAGGED HIGH-USAGE
      * SPECIAL ACCESS CIRCUITS FOR CAPACITY REVIEW.
       P3450-COUNT-WRAP.
           ADD 1 TO WS-WINDOW-WRAP-CNT.
       P3450-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       P3500-SAVE-LAST-KEY.
           MOVE WS-CURR-OCNBAN TO WS-LAST-OCNBAN.
           MOVE CD-SEQ-NBR     TO WS-LAST-SEQ.
           IF CD-SEQ-NBR > WS-MAX-SEQ-SEEN
               MOVE CD-SEQ-NBR TO WS-MAX-SEQ-SEEN.
       P3500-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       P3600-BUILD-DUP-SUSPENSE.
           MOVE EC-DUP-SEQ        TO SU-ERR-CODE.
           MOVE 'E'               TO SU-ERR-SEVERITY.
           MOVE WS-PGM-NAME       TO SU-DETECT-PGM.
           MOVE 'P3300-CHECK-SEQ-DUP' TO WS-DETECT-PARA-LIT.
           MOVE WS-DETECT-PARA-LIT TO SU-DETECT-PARA.
           MOVE CT-RUN-ID         TO SU-RUN-ID.
           MOVE CD-SEQ-NBR        TO WS-DUP-SEQ-DISPLAY.
           MOVE CABS-CDR-RECORD   TO SU-ORIG-RECORD.
           MOVE SPACES            TO SU-FILLER.
           CALL 'CABERRWR' USING CABS-SUSPENSE-RECORD.
           WRITE SUS-OUT-RECORD FROM CABS-SUSPENSE-RECORD.
       P3600-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       P3700-WRITE-DUP-OUT.
           WRITE DUP-OUT-RECORD FROM CABS-CDR-RECORD.
           ADD 1 TO WS-WRITE-CNT.
           MOVE CD-SEQ-NBR TO WS-HASH-SEQ-IN.
           MOVE CD-OCN     TO WS-HASH-OCN-IN.
           CALL 'CABHASH' USING WS-ACC-SEQ-HASH WS-HASH-SEQ-IN
                                 WS-ACC-OCN-HASH WS-HASH-OCN-IN.
       P3700-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       S800-CONTROL SECTION.
      * THIS STEP NEVER SUMMARISES OR CARRIES RECORDS FORWARD, SO
      * BOTH COUNTS ARE ALWAYS ZERO HERE.
       P8000-CONTROL.
           MOVE WS-PGM-NAME    TO CT-JOBNAME.
           MOVE WS-PGM-NAME    TO CT-STEPNAME.
           MOVE ZERO           TO CT-BILL-PERIOD.
           MOVE WS-READ-CNT    TO CT-READ.
           MOVE WS-WRITE-CNT   TO CT-WRITTEN.
           MOVE WS-REJECT-CNT  TO CT-REJECTED.
           MOVE ZERO           TO CT-SUMMARISED.
           MOVE ZERO           TO CT-CARRIED-FWD.
           MOVE WS-ACC-MINUTES TO CT-HASH-MINUTES.
           MOVE WS-ACC-AMOUNT  TO CT-HASH-AMOUNT.
           MOVE WS-ACC-SEQ-HASH TO CT-HASH-SEQ.
           MOVE WS-ACC-OCN-HASH TO CT-HASH-OCN.
           IF CT-READ = CT-WRITTEN + CT-REJECTED
                        + CT-SUMMARISED + CT-CARRIED-FWD
               MOVE 'B' TO CT-BAL-IND
           ELSE
               MOVE 'O' TO CT-BAL-IND.
           MOVE ZERO   TO CT-RC.
           MOVE SPACES TO CT-ABEND-CD.
           MOVE SPACES TO CT-RESTART-KEY.
           MOVE SPACES TO CT-FILLER.
           WRITE CTL-OUT-RECORD FROM CABS-CONTROL-RECORD.
       P8000-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       S900-TERM SECTION.
       P9000-TERM.
           CLOSE VLDIN.
           CLOSE DUPOUT.
           CLOSE SUSOUT.
           CLOSE CTLOUT.
       P9000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
